    "Apply (on Review and Apply)" : {
      "comment" : "Name of a command in the list of Settings ▸ Keys and Help ▸ Keyboard Shortcuts, where the menu title changes with the state (Show/Hide). Title case. The key that carries out the decisions, which works only on the Review and Apply screen.",
