    "Culla is not allowed to change “%@”, so it cannot move or mark anything in it. You can copy the keepers to another folder instead; this folder is only read." : {
      "comment" : "Explains on the Review and Apply screen why Apply is unavailable. %@ is the shoot folder's name. 'Keepers' are the photos that are kept.",
