    },
    "Each stack shows as one tile until View ▸ Expand All Stacks." : {
      "comment" : "Note under the setting 'Collapse stacks in All Photos' in Settings ▸ General, when no key is set for expanding stacks. 'View ▸ Expand All Stacks' is a menu and its item: use their names in your language and keep the ▸.",
