          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit ▸ Undo cannot bring it back." : {
      "comment" : "Ends a notice or alert after a change, saying how to take it back. Used when Undo has no key, in a warning that a change cannot be undone. 'Edit ▸ Undo' is the Edit menu's Undo item; use the names macOS uses and keep the ▸.",
