    },
    "Edit ▸ Undo puts it back." : {
      "comment" : "Ends a notice or alert after a change, saying how to take it back. Used when Undo has no key, after a frame was split out of its stack. 'Edit ▸ Undo' is the Edit menu's Undo item; use the names macOS uses and keep the ▸.",
