          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How alike neighbouring frames must look. Higher joins more." : {
      "comment" : "One line of help under a control in the detection tuning panel and in Settings. At most about 70 characters. Explains the control 'Visual similarity'.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
