        "tk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Goňşy kadrlar nä derejede meňzeş bolmaly. Ýokary — köpräk birleşýär."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How different two copies may look and still match." : {
      "comment" : "One line of help under a control in the detection tuning panel and in Settings. At most about 70 characters. Explains the control 'Near-duplicate distance up to'.",
