    "How sure Vision must be, from 0 to 1." : {
      "comment" : "One line of help under a control in the detection tuning panel and in Settings. At most about 70 characters. Explains the control 'Smudge confidence above'. 'Certain' is the name of a confidence level. 'Vision' is Apple's framework, not translated.",
