    "Sidecars (.xmp) are written beside %lld kept or rated and %lld rejected photos, recording the decision and star rating. Existing sidecars keep everything else in them. Image files are never changed." : {
      "comment" : "A sentence on the Review and Apply screen, under the chosen action, saying what applying will do. The first number is the kept (or rated) photos, the second the rejected photos; both are at least 1. Glossary: sidecar.",
